rids, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids, September to October and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. In 2025, November to December ran 21% of normal on the middle of the grids. In 2026 so far, January to February came in at 42% and February to March at 45%, also on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
